~ daze_enemy_tutorial
Daze.Neutral: Careful Ms. Levenor, this monster is emmiting a [color=#57a0f9]Blue Aura[/color]!
Daze.Neutral: You understand what this means, don't you?
Daze.Neutral: Just stand back and defend youself.
Mira.Angry: Don't treat me like a baby, I can help!
$>> bt.screen_shake()
Daze.Neutral: That won't be necessary if [color=#fcde42]Static Saber[/color] can finish it off!
$> Party.get_member("Daze").next_action = Actor.BtAction.MAGIC
$> Party.get_member("Daze").next_move = Query.get_ability("StaticSaber")
$> Party.get_meNeutralmber("Mira").controllable = true
=> END

